<view class="about-page">
  <view class="about-card">
    <view class="about-title">版本信息</view>
    <block wx:if="{{failed}}">
      <view class="about-row"><text class="about-k">状态</text><text class="about-v">{{failed}}</text></view>
    </block>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="about-row"><text class="about-k">前端版本</text><text class="about-v" id="aboutBuild">{{build || '—'}}</text></view>
      <view class="about-row"><text class="about-k">提交号</text><text class="about-v">{{commit || '—'}}</text></view>
      <view class="about-row"><text class="about-k">服务启动</text><text class="about-v">{{builtAt || '—'}}</text></view>
    </block>
    <view class="about-note">这三项由服务端下发。网页后台左下角显示的是同一个前端版本号 —— 两边对不上,说明有一端的缓存是旧的。</view>
  </view>
</view>
